From 29f34b7ad039ad84e9ce6b1202c5a7304d7aa54f Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: blame42 <346530647+git-blame-42@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Thu, 5 Nov 2026 17:30:48 -0300
Subject: [PATCH] feat: Add certificate checkbox to events
MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

Add has_certificate (TINYINT NOT NULL) to events with a checkbox in the
admin form. A hidden input with value 0 comes before the checkbox so an
unchecked box is still posted. The model normalizes null/empty to '0'
and the int read from the database to '0'/'1' before inclusion(['0','1']),
so unchecked boxes no longer hit NULL on a NOT NULL column and saved
events stay valid on edit. List and details show Sim/Não.
